cess audit of ui surfac the first concret step wa keyboard navig on the redact preview so review can move through preview control without a point devic 2026 08 21 keyboard pas diana exercis keyboard navig on the preview surfac and move the task to activ a screen reader trial wa plan a a later step in the same audit and is not document here sourc id src gdoc 33 access find keyboard pas on preview owner diana document key doc 2033 last updat 2026 09 08 retrospect cover 2026 08 21 t039 open a an access audit of ui surfac the first concret step wa keyboard navig on the redact preview so review can move through preview control without a point devic supersess on 2026 08 24 alic supersed the a11y audit the complet visual preview overlay overhaul t023 wa judg to alreadi cover the style and access scope this task track the keyboard pas find therefor did not continu a a standalon a11y workstream\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9da74908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-08-Accessibility-a11y-Audit-Review.md\", \"id\": \"dbbb35710d0c00e8\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3266712326143562, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.14544637230622318, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74952924, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-08-Accessibility-a11y-Audit-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9da74908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-08-Accessibility-a11y-Audit-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-08-Accessibility-a11y-Audit-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 892, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:06\", \"token_count\": 322, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTrack the mandatory release gates for CipherDoc v1.0 (WS-03). The initial checklist draft depended on T001 through T006 and T010. A later prerequisite audit found the checklist still incomplete while T005 (Docker image slim-down/CVE work) and T029 (Windows code-signing) remained open, and release notes were drafted in parallel while gates stayed open. Diana placed a security-gate hold on the release pending both T005's Docker slim-down/CVE work and T029's Windows Defender/SmartScreen code-signing; the task remains Active with those two gates unresolved.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Checklist dependencies T001-T006 and T010 satisfied (met; those tasks are Completed).\\n\\n- T005 (Docker image size/CVE) and T029 (Windows code-signing) gates clear (not yet met; task remains Active pending both).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTrack the mandatory release gates for CipherDoc v1.0 (WS-03). The initial checklist draft depended on T001 through T006 and T010. A later prerequisite audit found the checklist still incomplete while T005 (Docker image slim-down/CVE work) and T029 (Windows code-signing) remained open, and release notes were drafted in parallel while gates s