6-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9a8a8848a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1278, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:48\", \"token_count\": 583, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-09\\n\\n# Redaction Pipeline — Security Scan Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2009\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-07-06\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nSecurity audit of the redaction pipeline (T010, WS-03). This report records findings as of the 2026-07-06 scan only; it is not a live task-status tracker.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-09\\n\\n# Redaction Pipeline — Security Scan Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2009\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-07-06\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\nThe 2026-07-06 scan flagged a medium-severity CORS misconfiguration: the API responds with `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`. That wildcard origin must be restricted before T010 can close. No patch has been applied as of this scan date.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-09\\n\\n# Redaction Pipeline — Security Scan Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2009\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-07-06\\n\\n## Status (as of 2026-07-06)\\n\\nActive — CORS finding handed to engineering for patching.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-09\\n\\n# Redaction Pipeline — Security Scan Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2009\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-07-06\\n\\n## Next Step\\n\\nAwait a CORS patch (restrict to configured `ALLOWED_ORIGINS`) and re-verification before this task moves to Completed. Later patch and re-scan outcomes are outside the scope of this dated scan report.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 09 redact pipelin secur scan report owner diana document key doc 2009 last updat 2026 07 06 scope secur audit of the redact pipelin t010 w 03 this report record find a of the 2026 07 06 scan onli it is not a live task status tracker sourc id src gdoc 09 redact pipelin secur scan report owner diana document key doc 2009 last updat 2026 07 06 find the 2026 07 06 scan flag a medium sever cor misconfigur the api respond with access control allow origin that wildcard origin must be restrict befor t010 can close no patch ha been appli a of this scan date sourc id src gdoc 09 redact pipelin secur scan report owner diana document key doc 2009 last updat 2026 07 06 status a of 2026 07 06 activ cor find hand to engin for patch sourc id src gdoc 09 redact pipelin secur scan report owner diana document key doc 2009 last updat 2026 07 06 next step await a cor patch restrict to configur allow _ origin and re verif befor this task move to complet later patch and re scan outcom are outsid the scope of this date scan report\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9e2a1d88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-06-Vulnerability-Scan.md\", \"id\": \"b20a1aa0db99edad\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2920390508176356, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1122978011680509, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7114353, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-06-Vulnerability-Scan.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9e2a1d88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-06-Vulnerability-Scan.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-06-Vulnerability-Scan.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 867, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:00:56\", \"token_count\": 370, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Original Finding: Ghostscript (AGPLv3)\\n\\nThe initial audit flagged `Ghostscript`, used by the `rasterizer` module for PDF-to-image conversion, as AGPLv3-licensed — on the corporate license blacklist because of its viral copyleft terms for any binary distributed to partner sites.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## First Remediation and Reopen\\n\\nThe team swapped in an alternative PDF parser library to replace the Ghostscript dependency, and that swap was initially marked Completed. On follow-up review, however, the replacement library itself turned out to also be AGPL-licensed — the swap solved the specific Ghostscript dependency but reintroduced the same license category problem one layer down. The task was reopened.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Current Status: Unresolved\\n\\nCharlie is now searching for an Apache 2.0 or MIT-licensed PDF parser alternative that meets the module's rasterization requirements. No suitable replacement has been confirmed yet, so this audit item remains **Active (Reopened)** — not resolved.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-41\\n\\n# Dependency Inventory: License Compliance Audit (Q3) — Reopened\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2041\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (reflects reopen activity through 2026-08-15)\\n\\n## Secondary Open Item\\n\\nTesseract OCR itself is Apache 2.0, but the `eng.traineddata` model files were sourced from a community repository and their training-corpus provenance has not been verified as public-domain/CC0. This remains a separate, lower-priority open item pending Evan's trace of the `tessdata_best` provenance.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 origin find ghostscript agplv3 the initi audit flag ghostscript use by the raster modul for pdf to imag convers a agplv3 licens on the corpor licens blacklist becaus of it viral copyleft term for ani binari distribut to partner site sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 first remedi and reopen the team swap in an altern pdf parser librari to replac the ghostscript depend and that swap wa initi mark complet on follow up review howev the replac librari itself turn out to also be agpl licens the swap solv the specif ghostscript depend but reintroduc the same licens categori problem one layer down the task wa reopen sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 current status unresolv charli is now search for an apach 20 or mit licens pdf parser altern that meet the modul s raster requir no suitabl replac ha been confirm yet so this audit item remain activ reopen not resolv sourc id src gdoc 41 depend inventori licens complianc audit q3 reopen owner diana document key doc 2041 last updat 2026 08 21 reflect reopen activ through 2026 08 15 secondari open item tesseract ocr itself is apach 20 but the eng traineddata model file were sourc from a communiti repositori and their train corpus proven ha not been verifi a public domain cc0 this remain a separ lower prioriti open item pend evan s trace of the tessdata _ best proven\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9d4f0568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"039b629d788751dd\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2890871588176356, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1122978011680509, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70159566, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9d4f0568a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1689, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:12\", \"token_count\": 582, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {\"question\": \"Sentry crash reporter telemetry opt out audit status September 2026\", \"similarity_threshold\": 0.2, \"vector_weight\": 0.3, \"keyword_search\": false, \"dataset_count\": 1}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
