for the releas gate 2026 09 02 evan sign cert miss activ found that window defend smartscreen block the unsign build becaus a code sign certif is still miss task remain activ\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e95e78f48a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-39-Windows-Compatibility.md\", \"id\": \"b781255db8f4d9fe\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.23578812363963242, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.04596456948518918, \"vector_similarity\": 0.67870975, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-39-Windows-Compatibility.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e95e78f48a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-39-Windows-Compatibility.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-39-Windows-Compatibility.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1115, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:51\", \"token_count\": 532, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTrack the mandatory release gates for CipherDoc v1.0 (WS-03). The initial checklist draft depended on T001 through T006 and T010. A later prerequisite audit found the checklist still incomplete while T005 (Docker image slim-down/CVE work) and T029 (Windows code-signing) remained open, and release notes were drafted in parallel while gates stayed open. Diana placed a security-gate hold on the release pending both T005's Docker slim-down/CVE work and T029's Windows Defender/SmartScreen code-signing; the task remains Active with those two gates unresolved.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Checklist dependencies T001-T006 and T010 satisfied (met; those tasks are Completed).\\n\\n- T005 (Docker image size/CVE) and T029 (Windows code-signing) gates clear (not yet met; task remains Active pending both).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-21\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-21\\n\\n**Title**: Release v1.0 Gates\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTrack the mandatory release gates for CipherDoc v1.0 (WS-03). The initial checklist draft depended on T001 through T006 and T010. A later prerequisite audit found the checklist still incomplete while T005 (Docker image slim-down/CVE work) and T029 (Windows code-signing) remained open, and release notes were drafted in parallel while gates stayed open. Diana placed a security-gate hold on the release pending both T005's Docker slim-down/CVE work and T029's Windows Defender/SmartScreen code-signing; the task remains Active with those two gates unresolved.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 21 sourc id src cu ciph 21 task id ciph 21 titl releas v1 0 gate status activ assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 07 08 descript track the mandatori releas gate for cipherdoc v1 0 w 03 the initi checklist draft depend on t001 through t006 and t010 a later prerequisit audit found the checklist still incomplet while t005 docker imag slim down cve work and t029 window code sign remain open and releas note were draft in parallel while gate stay open diana place a secur gate hold on the releas pend both t005 s docker slim down cve work and t029 s window defend smart