r cli wire 2026 09 10 bob cli integr activ wire audit log generat into the cli path now that the schema wa defin to satisfi the releas gate 2026 09 18 diana audit verifi mismatch activ verif found the cli emit audit record inconsist with the defin schema this mismatch remain an open releas blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"a015962ae73f1229\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3577913119404762, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.19047619134353744, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74819326, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-10\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Pre-Release Audit\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-15\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nPre-release gate review: Docker slim/CVE, Windows signing, and upstream high-DPI remain open. Audit-log path still a hold — CLI schema and emitted records don't match.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-10\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Pre-Release Audit\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-15\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Transcript\\n\\n**Alice**: We're in pre-release mode. Gate check first: Docker slim-down and CVE work is still open, Windows signing is still open, and we're still blocked upstream on the high-DPI rendering bug. Those stay on the board. Diana, where are we on the audit-log gate?\\n\\n**Diana**: Still a hold. The CLI path and the log records aren't matching the schema we defined. That undercuts the audit trail as release evidence.\\n\\n**Bob**: I've been wiring audit-log generation into the CLI. The shape coming out still isn't consistent with what the schema expects — I've got another pass queued.\\n\\n**Charlie**: So this isn't a packaging issue — it's schema versus emitted records?\\n\\n**Diana**: Yes. Until those match, I can't clear the audit gate.\\n\\n**Evan**: That stacks on top of the Docker and Windows holds Alice listed. Release isn't opening with any of those unresolved.\\n\\n**Alice**: Correct. Security-gate work stays open — Docker slim-down, Windows signing, and we keep the audit mismatch visible as a release blocker. No one closes those today.\\n\\n**Diana**: I'll keep the audit-log gate red until schema and records match.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src meet 10 firefli transcript pre releas audit date 2026 09 15 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop summari pre releas gate review docker slim cve window sign and upstream high dpi remain open audit log path still a hold cli schema and emit record don t match sourc id src meet 10 firefli transcript pre releas audit date 2026 09 15 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop transcript alic we re in pre releas mode gate check first docker slim down and cve work is still open window sign is still open and we re still block upstream on the high dpi render bug those stay on the board diana where are we on the audit log gate diana still a hold the cli path and the log record aren t match the schema we defin that undercut the audit trail a releas evid bob i ve been wire audit log generat into the cli the shape come out still isn t consist with what the schema expect i ve got anoth pas queu charli so this isn t a packag issu it s schema versus emit record diana yes until those match i can t clear the audit gate evan that stack on top of the docker and window hold alic list releas isn t open with ani of those unresolv alic correct secur gate work stay open docker slim down window sign and we keep the audit mismatch visibl a a releas blocker no one close those today diana i ll keep the audit log gate red until schema and record match\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e94edcc88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"id\": \"be17298264309b61\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3499023139404762, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.19047619134353744, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7218966, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e94edcc88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-15-Pre-Release-Audit.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1495, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:06\", \"token_count\": 424, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- SHA-256 hash is computed for every input stream and captured in the audit record.\\n\\n- Companion JSON schema pairs the input hash with the redaction map for each processed file.\\n\\n- Audit-log generation is wired into the CLI batch path.\\n\\n- CLI-emitted audit records validate cleanly against the defined companion JSON schema (currently failing verification).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-07-08**: Diana - Task C