", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3482691739404762, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.19047619134353744, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7164528, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-26\\n\\n# Exportable Redaction-Profile Schema (Design)\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2026\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-25\\n\\nLooking back at the 2026-08-12 design pass for T032: compliance needs a machine-readable export of the active redaction profile so reviewers can inspect and reuse the same rules outside a single running instance.\\n\\n## Why a schema first\\n\\nWithout a stable export shape, any later API or CLI dump would drift. Bob started by defining what an exportable profile must carry—enough structure to represent the active redaction rules in a portable, auditable form—before wiring an endpoint.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-26\\n\\n# Exportable Redaction-Profile Schema (Design)\\n\\n**Owner**: Bob\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2026\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-25\\n\\nLooking back at the 2026-08-12 design pass for T032: compliance needs a machine-readable export of the active redaction profile so reviewers can inspect and reuse the same rules outside a single running instance.\\n\\n## Boundary of this note\\n\\nThis is the design step only. Implementing a schema-export API and verifying it against the REST contract were not part of the 2026-08-12 work and are not claimed here. As of that date the task remained Active.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 26 export redact profil schema design owner bob document key doc 2026 last updat 2026 08 25 look back at the 2026 08 12 design pas for t032 complianc need a machin readabl export of the activ redact profil so review can inspect and reus the same rule outsid a singl run instanc whi a schema first without a stabl export shape ani later api or cli dump would drift bob start by defin what an export profil must carri enough structur to repres the activ redact rule in a portabl audit form befor wire an endpoint sourc id src gdoc 26 export redact profil schema design owner bob document key doc 2026 last updat 2026 08 25 look back at the 2026 08 12 design pas for t032 complianc need a machin readabl export of the activ redact profil so review can inspect and reus the same rule outsid a singl run instanc boundari of this note this is the design step onli implement a schema export api and verifi it against the rest contract were not part of the 2026 08 12 work and are not claim here a of that date the task remain activ\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9c775668a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-25-Redaction-Profile-Export-Review.md\", \"id\": \"61efa8e33bd86122\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2651781673452381, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.095238096207483, \"vector_similarity\": 0.661705, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-25-Redaction-Profile-Export-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9c775668a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-25-Redaction-Profile-Export-Review.md\", \"locat