 strict air-gapped claim, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline. The offline batch run completed and was signed off, with a noted 45-second remote licence-check hang recorded; this sign-off is preliminary only and is not a compliance certification.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-04**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 37 sourc id src cu ciph 37 task id ciph 37 titl valid batch run under a network deni har status complet assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript build a reproduc offlin test har that deni network access then execut a full batch run under it to valid the strict air gap claim depend on the complet ae 256 encrypt pipelin the offlin batch run complet and wa sign off with a note 45 second remot licenc check hang record this sign off is preliminari onli and is not a complianc certif clickup task ciph 37 sourc id src cu ciph 37 task id ciph 37 titl valid batch run under a network deni har status complet assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 accept criterion offlin test har reliabl deni network access dure a batch run full batch execut success to complet under the har with network block sign off explicit note it is preliminari and not a complianc certif along with the observ licenc check hang clickup task ciph 37 sourc id src cu ciph 37 task id ciph 37 titl valid batch run under a network deni har status complet assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript build a reproduc offlin test har that deni network access then execut a full batch run under it to valid the strict air gap claim depend on the complet ae 256 encrypt pipelin the offlin batch run complet and wa sign off with a note 45 second remot licenc check hang record this sign off is preliminari onli and is not a complianc certif clickup task ciph 37 sourc id src cu ciph 37 task id ciph 37 titl valid batch run under a network deni har status complet assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 activ histori 2026 08 04 alic task creat open\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"id\": \"9519be2c22917b0d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.35781032264430146, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.154985535206145, \"vector_similarity\": 0.83106816, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e969dcb28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-37-Air-Gapped-Mode-Testing.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1365, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:41\", \"token_count\": 610, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## What Was Run\\n\\nA full batch redaction run was executed under the offline test harness (T027) with network access denied, using a local sample document set. The run depended on the completed AES-256 at-rest encryption pipeline (T021), since offline output still needs to be encrypted without any network-based key service.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nThe batch completed successfully end-to-end with the network denied: no network-dependent call blocked the run, and local policy parsing worked entirely from bundled definitions.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Noted Issue: 45-Second Licence-Check Hang\\n\\nThe run was not clean — the HTTP client attempted to verify the license key against a remote server before timing out and falling back to the cached local license, adding roughly 45 seconds of startup delay. This is logged as a known issue, not something this sign-off waives.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-47\\n\\n# Sign-off Note: Offline Batch Run (Preliminary)\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2047\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-10\\n\\n## Scope of This Sign-off\\n\\nThis sign-off is **preliminary** and covers functional completion of a batch run offline only. It is explicitly **not** a compliance certification — it does not cover side-channel analysis, physical security, or any regulatory attestation. No patient records or clinical data were used in this test run.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 what wa run a full batch redact run wa execut under the offlin test har t027 with network access deni use a local sampl document set the run depend on the complet ae 256 at rest encrypt pipelin t021 sinc offlin output still need to be encrypt without ani network base key servic sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 result the batch complet success end to end with the network deni no network depend call block the run and local polici pars work entir from bundl definit sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 note issu 45 second licenc check hang the run wa not clean the http client attempt to verifi the licens key against a remot server befor time out and fall back to the cach local licens ad rough 45 second of startup delay this is log a a known issu not someth this sign off waif sourc id src gdoc 47 sign off note offlin batch run preliminari owner diana document key doc 2047 last updat 2026 08 10 scope of this sign off this sign off is preliminari and cover function complet of a batch run offlin onli it is explicit not a complianc certif it doe not cover side channel analysi physic secur or ani regulatori attest no patient record or clinic data were use in this test run\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9b0c0dc8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"id\": \"5b05fa1d83b734fd\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33224285615616944, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1162391516516706, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8362515, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9b0c0dc8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-10-Air-Gapped-Mode-Offline-Signoff.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1322, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:40\", \"token_count\": 456, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDefine how the redaction engine resolves conflicts when multiple policy rules overlap on the same content. The team implemented a union rule for overlapping policies, recorded the decision as durable compliance evidence, and later regression-checked it against the HIPAA pattern update work to confirm the merge still holds.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Overlapping-policy conflicts resolve deterministically using the union rule.\\n\\n- Union rule decision is recorded in the compliance pack as durable evidence.\\n\\n- Conflict-resolution behavior is regression-checked against subsequent detection-pattern changes without breaking the merge.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDefine how the redaction engine resolves conflicts when multiple policy rules overlap on the same content. The team implemented a union rule for overlapping policies, recorded the decision as durable compliance evidence, and later regression-checked it against the HIPAA pattern update work to confirm the merge still holds.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Activity History\