**: SRC-GDOC-08\\n\\n# REST API — Security Check Complete\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2008\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-06-17\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nCheck complete with no findings blocking closure of the task.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-08\\n\\n# REST API — Security Check Complete\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2008\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-06-17\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nCompleted.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 08 rest api secur check complet owner diana document key doc 2008 last updat 2026 06 17 scope secur check of the fastapi base rest api endpoint t004 built on top of the redact engin sourc id src gdoc 08 rest api secur check complet owner diana document key doc 2008 last updat 2026 06 17 result check complet with no find block closur of the task sourc id src gdoc 08 rest api secur check complet owner diana document key doc 2008 last updat 2026 06 17 status complet\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9b571908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-17-API-Security-Test.md\", \"id\": \"9bdd35be1ae7c695\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.26341413429752064, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09090909185360094, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6659259, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-17-API-Security-Test.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9b571908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-17-API-Security-Test.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-17-API-Security-Test.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 346, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:37\", \"token_count\": 195, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-12\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Batch Failure Strategy (Fail-Closed)\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-07-16\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 10:09] Bob**: For the batch fail-closed question, we need to decide what happens if the engine crashes halfway through a 1,000-file batch. Do we keep the successful ones?\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 10:26] Charlie**: Absolutely not. If we can't guarantee 100% of the batch is safe, we should fail-closed. No partial exports.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 10:28] Bob**: Agreed. Drafting the plan now. If any worker node throws an unhandled exception, we abort the entire job and purge the output buffer.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 10:43] Charlie**: I've added an exception hook to the core engine. It catches low-level segfaults and signals the controller to stop all active streams.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 11:23] Bob**: Implementation complete. Added an atomic rename step at the very end — the output folder stays empty until the last file is verified.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 12:53] Diana**: What about logs? We need to know *why* it failed.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 13:16] Bob**: Crash report gets written to a separate `audit_log.json` before the shutdown. Captures the stack trace and the filename that triggered the fault.\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 13:17] Charlie**: Perfect. :lock:\\n\\n**[2026-06-12 13:19] Alice**: Thanks.\\n\\n**[2026-07-16 09:30] Diana**: QA pass on fail-closed is done — confirmed no output file gets written on failure and the temp files get securely deleted. Signing off before the encryption and offline work start relying on this.\\n\\n**[2026-07-16 09:31] Bob**: Calling this done.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 12 slack thread batch failur strategi fail close channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 06 12 last activ 2026 07 16 2026 06 12 10 09 bob for the batch fail close question we need to decid what happe