971, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07725326530281572, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7632036, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-08-Compliance-Audit-Trail.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9bdc66a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-08-Compliance-Audit-Trail.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-08-Compliance-Audit-Trail.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 735, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:28\", \"token_count\": 309, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement fail-closed behavior for the batch engine so a processing failure never releases an unredacted output file (WS-04). Bob completed the implementation on 2026-06-15. On 2026-07-16 Diana's QA pass validated the fail-closed behavior - confirming no output file is produced on failure and that temp files are securely deleted - ahead of the encryption (T021) and offline-mode (T027) work that depends on it.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Fail-closed implementation completed (2026-06-15).\\n\\n- QA-validated: no output file produced on failure, and temp files are securely deleted.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement fail-closed behavior for the batch engine so a processing failure never releases an unredacted output file (WS-04). Bob completed the implementation on 2026-06-15. On 2026-07-16 Diana's QA pass validated the fail-closed behavior - confirming no output file is produced on failure and that temp files are securely deleted - ahead of the encryption (T021) and offline-mode (T027) work that depends on it.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 25 sourc id src cu ciph 25 task id ciph 25 titl batch process fail close strategi status complet assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 06 08 descript implement fail close behavior for the batch engin so a process failur never releas an unredact output file w 04 bob complet the implement on 2026 06 15 on 2026 07 16 diana s qa pas valid the fail close behavior confirm no output file is produc on failur and that temp file are secur delet ahead of the encrypt t021 and offlin mode t027 work that depend on it clickup task ciph 25 sourc id src cu ciph 25 task id ciph 25 titl batch process fail close strategi status complet assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 06 08 accept criterion fail close implement complet 2026 06 15 qa valid no output file produc on failur and temp file are secur delet clickup task ciph 25 sourc id src cu ciph 25 task id ciph 25 titl batch process fail close strategi status complet assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 06 08 descript implement fail close behavior for the batch engin so a process failur never releas an unredact output file w 04 bob complet the 